stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Capture: preview/create request
  Capture --> READY: complete non-empty matrix persisted
  Capture --> Rejected: incomplete data or no eligible transaction items
  READY --> [*]: frozen config, hashes and rows; immutable
  Rejected --> [*]: request returns validation error
  note right of READY: Schema permits READY or FAILED; current create path persists READY only.
  note right of Rejected: Invalid input returns before a snapshot record is persisted; no DRAFT/BUILDING state.
